    "title": "SSO fix: clock skew and the security review",
    "content": "",
    "note_type": "meeting",
    "transcript": [
      {
        "id": "seg-mv4ik7dk-1",
        "text": "Quick one on SSO. Ines found the SAML failure.",
        "source": "mic",
        "timestamp": 1791765003823,
        "startMs": 3823,
        "endMs": 8959,
        "speaker": "speaker_1",
        "speakerName": "Theo",
        "speakerIsPlaceholder": false,
        "speakerStatus": "locked",
        "speakerLocked": false
      },
      {
        "id": "seg-mv4ik7dk-2",
        "text": "The SSO failure is clock skew. Their SAML assertions arrive a few seconds early.",
        "source": "mic",
        "timestamp": 1791765010357,
        "startMs": 10357,
        "endMs": 17035,
        "speaker": "speaker_2",
        "speakerName": "Ines",
        "speakerIsPlaceholder": false,
        "speakerStatus": "locked",
        "speakerLocked": false
      },
      {
        "id": "seg-mv4ik7dk-3",
        "text": "Our SAML library rejects anything stamped in the future, so the SSO login fails.",
        "source": "mic",
        "timestamp": 1791765017863,
        "startMs": 17863,
        "endMs": 24170,
        "speaker": "speaker_2",
        "speakerName": "Ines",
        "speakerIsPlaceholder": false,
        "speakerStatus": "locked",
        "speakerLocked": false
      },
      {
        "id": "seg-mv4ik7dk-4",
        "text": "The SAML fix is a clock tolerance setting. Twelve lines.",
        "source": "mic",
        "timestamp": 1791765025174,
        "startMs": 25174,
        "endMs": 30591,
        "speaker": "speaker_1",
        "speakerName": "Theo",
        "speakerIsPlaceholder": false,
        "speakerStatus": "locked",
        "speakerLocked": false
      },
      {
        "id": "seg-mv4ik7dk-5",
        "text": "One test tenant drifted forty seconds, but that was their misconfigured clock, not the SAML library.",
        "source": "mic",
        "timestamp": 1791765032223,
        "startMs": 32223,
        "endMs": 39372,
        "speaker": "speaker_2",
        "speakerName": "Ines",
        "speakerIsPlaceholder": false,
        "speakerStatus": "locked",
        "speakerLocked": false
      },
      {
        "id": "seg-mv4ik7dk-6",
        "text": "How much tolerance are you thinking?",
        "source": "mic",
        "timestamp": 1791765040575,
        "startMs": 40575,
        "endMs": 43977,
        "speaker": "speaker_3",
        "speakerName": "Ruth",
        "speakerIsPlaceholder": false,
        "speakerStatus": "locked",
        "speakerLocked": false
      },
      {
        "id": "seg-mv4ik7dk-7",
        "text": "Two minutes, like the SAML library default.",
        "source": "mic",
        "timestamp": 1791765044994,
        "startMs": 44994,
        "endMs": 48988,
        "speaker": "speaker_1",
        "speakerName": "Theo",
        "speakerIsPlaceholder": false,
        "speakerStatus": "locked",
        "speakerLocked": false
      },
      {
        "id": "seg-mv4ik7dk-8",
        "text": "Two minutes opens a replay window on SSO logins. I want it logged and alerted.",
        "source": "mic",
        "timestamp": 1791765049930,
        "startMs": 49930,
        "endMs": 58014,
        "speaker": "speaker_3",
        "speakerName": "Ruth",
        "speakerIsPlaceholder": false,
        "speakerStatus": "locked",
        "speakerLocked": false
      },
      {
        "id": "seg-mv4ik7dk-9",
        "text": "And the SSO fix needs a full security review before it ships.",
        "source": "mic",
        "timestamp": 1791765059047,
        "startMs": 59047,
        "endMs": 65543,
        "speaker": "speaker_3",
        "speakerName": "Ruth",
        "speakerIsPlaceholder": false,
        "speakerStatus": "locked",
        "speakerLocked": false
      },
      {
        "id": "seg-mv4ik7dk-10",
        "text": "Can the security review start before the fix merges?",
        "source": "mic",
        "timestamp": 1791765067146,
        "startMs": 67146,
        "endMs": 72263,
        "speaker": "speaker_1",
        "speakerName": "Theo",
        "speakerIsPlaceholder": false,
        "speakerStatus": "locked",
        "speakerLocked": false
      },
      {
        "id": "seg-mv4ik7dk-11",
        "text": "Hmm.",
        "source": "mic",
        "timestamp": 1791765073832,
        "startMs": 73832,
        "endMs": 74596,
        "speaker": "speaker_3",
        "speakerName": "Ruth",
        "speakerIsPlaceholder": false,
        "speakerStatus": "locked",
        "speakerLocked": false
      },
      {
        "id": "seg-mv4ik7dk-12",
        "text": "Separately, the SOC 2 audit window closes on the 31st.",
        "source": "mic",
        "timestamp": 1791765075626,
        "startMs": 75626,
        "endMs": 81113,
        "speaker": "speaker_3",
        "speakerName": "Ruth",
        "speakerIsPlaceholder": false,
        "speakerStatus": "locked",
        "speakerLocked": false
      },
      {
        "id": "seg-mv4ik7dk-13",
        "text": "SSO is in the SOC 2 audit scope, so the auditors will want the SSO login events.",
        "source": "mic",
        "timestamp": 1791765081830,
        "startMs": 81830,
        "endMs": 91096,
        "speaker": "speaker_3",
        "speakerName": "Ruth",
        "speakerIsPlaceholder": false,
        "speakerStatus": "locked",
        "speakerLocked": false
      },
      {
        "id": "seg-mv4ik7dk-14",
        "text": "The SSO login events already go to the activity log.",
        "source": "mic",
        "timestamp": 1791765091834,
        "startMs": 91834,
        "endMs": 97482,
        "speaker": "speaker_1",
        "speakerName": "Theo",
        "speakerIsPlaceholder": false,
        "speakerStatus": "locked",
        "speakerLocked": false
      },
      {
        "id": "seg-mv4ik7dk-15",
        "text": "Good. Then the SOC 2 audit evidence is mostly there.",
        "source": "mic",
        "timestamp": 1791765098644,
        "startMs": 98644,
        "endMs": 104285,
        "speaker": "speaker_3",
        "speakerName": "Ruth",
        "speakerIsPlaceholder": false,
        "speakerStatus": "locked",
        "speakerLocked": false
      },
      {
        "id": "seg-mv4ik7dk-16",
        "text": "Do we know when the auditors start fieldwork?",
        "source": "mic",
        "timestamp": 1791765105409,
        "startMs": 105409,
        "endMs": 109505,
        "speaker": "speaker_2",
        "speakerName": "Ines",
        "speakerIsPlaceholder": false,
        "speakerStatus": "locked",
        "speakerLocked": false
      },
      {
        "id": "seg-mv4ik7dk-17",
        "text": "Not yet. Still waiting on Kestrel.",
        "source": "mic",
        "timestamp": 1791765110880,
        "startMs": 110880,
        "endMs": 114334,
        "speaker": "speaker_3",
        "speakerName": "Ruth",
        "speakerIsPlaceholder": false,
        "speakerStatus": "locked",
        "speakerLocked": false
      },
      {
        "id": "seg-mv4ik7dk-18",
        "text": "Kestrel hasn't confirmed the SOC 2 audit dates.",
        "source": "mic",
        "timestamp": 1791765115386,
        "startMs": 115386,
        "endMs": 119882,
        "speaker": "speaker_3",
        "speakerName": "Ruth",
        "speakerIsPlaceholder": false,
